calls-help-1 = Capturing on the network adapter is enough.
calls-help-2-lead = Phone on the router or on the phone system:
calls-help-2 = This computer does not see its traffic. Many routers capture it themselves (on a FRITZ!Box at { $path }); open the file under Capture → Capture file. Or port mirroring on the switch.
calls-help-3-lead = Encrypted:
calls-help-3 = SIP over TLS (port 5061) and SRTP cannot be read. Then there is no list of calls, at most streams without a call that cannot be played.
